# Scraped Xiaohongshu CSVs: contain xsec_token share credentials plus
# third-party nicknames and note IDs. This repo is public -- keep them local.
# scripts/xhs_bitable_loop.py reads them straight off disk.
# NOTE: comments here are ASCII on purpose. This file has been corrupted once
# before (every non-ASCII char became a literal "?"), which turned the pattern
# below into "?????/" -- and "?" is a single-char wildcard, so it silently
# ignored every 5-char directory including tests/ while no longer matching the
# directory it was meant to protect.
小红书搜集/

# Local screenshots from visual verification.
_shot/

# Internal audit reports (AI-generated code / design / API reviews).
# Kept out of the public repo for two independently sufficient reasons:
#   1. code-review.md is a *reproduced* vulnerability inventory with open
#      items (the live site still ships without CSP). Publishing your own
#      findings list for a running public site saves an attacker the recon.
#   2. They are internal working notes with undecided product calls, not
#      user-facing documentation.
# The files stay on disk (the backlog comes from them); they just aren't shipped.
docs/review/
